/**
 * @rootz/secret-orchestrator
 *
 * Hardened secret creation orchestrator for Rootz blockchain.
 * Coordinates the complete 7-step secret creation process.
 *
 *
 * @ai-context ./AI_CONTEXT.md
 * @ai-changelog ./.ai/changelog.jsonl
 * @ai-resources ./RESOURCES.md
 *
 * ## AI DOCUMENTATION
 *
 * ### What This Package Does
 * Orchestrates the complete secret creation process: key generation,
 * contract deployment, encryption, IPFS upload, and on-chain minting.
 *
 * ### Key Files (in order of importance)
 * - src/orchestrator.ts - SecretOrchestrator class (main entry point)
 * - src/types.ts - All type definitions and CryptoProvider interface
 * - src/mocks.ts - Mock implementations for testing
 * - tests/orchestrator.test.ts - Comprehensive tests (31 tests)
 *
 * This package provides a hardened, production-ready secret creation flow:
 *
 * ### Quick Start
 *
 * ```typescript
 * import {
 *   SecretOrchestrator,
 *   MockCryptoProvider,
 *   MockFactoryContract,
 *   createMockSigner,
 * } from '@rootz/secret-orchestrator';
 *
 * // For testing with mocks
 * const crypto = new MockCryptoProvider();
 * const factory = new MockFactoryContract();
 * const signer = createMockSigner();
 *
 * const orchestrator = new SecretOrchestrator(
 *   {
 *     factory: { address: '0x...', chainId: 80002, rpcUrl: '...', gas: { ... } },
 *     ipfs: { apiKey: '...', secretKey: '...' },
 *     signer,
 *     onProgress: (step) => console.log(`${step.stepNumber}/${step.totalSteps}: ${step.message}`),
 *   },
 *   crypto,
 *   factory
 * );
 *
 * const result = await orchestrator.createSecret({
 *   name: 'My Secret',
 *   type: 'ai-context',
 *   content: 'Secret content...',
 * });
 *
 * console.log(`Created: ${result.contractAddress}`);
 * ```
 *
 * ### 7-Step Creation Process
 *
 * | Step | Action | Output |
 * |------|--------|--------|
 * | 1 | Generate master key | 32-byte hex key |
 * | 2 | Deploy contract | Contract address |
 * | 3 | Encrypt content | Encrypted data + IV |
 * | 4 | Upload to IPFS | IPFS hash |
 * | 5 | Encrypt IPFS hash | VDN encrypted hash |
 * | 6 | Encrypt master key | Master key package |
 * | 7 | Mint secret | On-chain transaction |
 * | 8 | Create KeyVault | Optional team support |
 *
 * ### Error Handling
 *
 * ```typescript
 * try {
 *   const result = await orchestrator.createSecret(input);
 * } catch (error) {
 *   if (error instanceof OrchestrationError) {
 *     console.log(`Failed at: ${error.step}`);
 *     console.log(`Partial result:`, error.partialResult);
 *     // Contract may already be deployed - check partialResult
 *   }
 * }
 * ```
 *
 * ### Related Packages
 * - @rootz/chain-reader - Reads blockchain state (downstream)
 * - @rootz/message-processor - Stores created secrets (downstream)
 * - @rootz/team-invite - Shares secrets with team (downstream)
 * - @rootz/identity-provider - Uses identity for ownership (peer)
 *
 * ### CryptoProvider Interface
 * This package uses dependency injection for crypto. Implement:
 * - generateMasterKey(): Promise<string>
 * - encryptContent(content, key): Promise<EncryptedContent>
 * - encryptMasterKey(key, walletAddress): Promise<MasterKeyPackage>
 *
 * @see ../../AI_CONTEXT.md for system overview
 * @version 1.0.0
 */

