/**
 * @rootz/secret-orchestrator - Contract ABIs and Constants
 *
 * Contains production-ready ABIs for V4/V5 Factory contracts
 * and utilities for event parsing.
 *
 * ## AI DOCUMENTATION
 *
 * ### V6 Contract Architecture
 *
 * ```
 * ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
 * │                     CONTRACT HIERARCHY                          │
 * ├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
 * │                                                                 │
 * │  Factory (V5)                                                   │
 * │  ├── Creates Secret contracts                                   │
 * │  ├── Sets initial credits from RateTable                       │
 * │  └── Can call Secret.fundOperations()                          │
 * │                                                                 │
 * │  Registry (V3)                                                  │
 * │  ├── Holds user credit balances (userCredits[user])            │
 * │  ├── depositCredits() - POL → credits                          │
 * │  ├── fundSecretCredits(secret, amount) - transfers to secret   │
 * │  └── Can call Secret.fundOperations()                          │
 * │                                                                 │
 * │  Secret (V5)                                                    │
 * │  ├── Stores encrypted data in KeyVaults                        │
 * │  ├── ownerCredits[owner] - per-secret credits                  │
 * │  └── fundOperations() - RESTRICTED to factory/registry only    │
 * │                                                                 │
 * └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
 * ```
 *
 * ### Credits Flow (CRITICAL)
 *
 * ```
 * Step 1: User deposits POL to Registry
 * ───────────────────────────────────────
 * User ──► Registry.depositCredits{ value: POL }
 *          │
 *          └──► userCredits[user] += POL * 1_000_000
 *
 * Step 2: User transfers credits to specific Secret
 * ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * User ──► Registry.fundSecretCredits(secretAddr, amount)
 *          │
 *          ├── userCredits[user] -= amount
 *          │
 *          └──► Secret.fundOperations(user, amount)
 *               │
 *               └──► ownerCredits[user] += amount
 * ```
 *
 * **CRITICAL**: Secret.fundOperations() checks:
 * `require(msg.sender == factory || msg.sender == registry)`
 *
 * Direct calls from user wallets WILL FAIL. Always use Registry.
 *
 * ### Credit Constants (from Solidity)
 * - 1 POL = 1,000,000 credits
 * - CREDIT_LIMIT_PER_VAULT = -1000 (vault can go to -1000)
 * - CREDIT_LIMIT_PER_OWNER = -10000 (owner can go to -10000)
 * - Write cost = dataWriteBaseCost + (bytes * dataWritePerByte)
 */

